@startuml
title Bounded canonical admission pipeline

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #475569
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #7C3AED
  GroupBackgroundColor #F5F3FF
  GroupHeaderFontColor #4C1D95
}

actor Caller #FCE7F3
participant "Header + limit\nadmission" as Admission #FEF3C7
participant "Allocation-free\ncanonical scan" as Scan #DBEAFE
participant "Exact output\nconstruction" as Construct #EDE9FE
participant "schedlib semantic\nvalidation" as Core #DCFCE7

Caller -> Admission : untrusted complete frame + limits
Admission -> Admission : byte cap, fixed header, checked totals, work

alt invalid header, overflow, limit, or cancellation
  Admission --> Caller : typed rejection; no allocation or result
else admitted fixed frame
  Admission -> Scan : bounded payload slice
  Scan -> Scan : forward cursors validate lengths and order
  alt malformed or noncanonical payload
    Scan --> Caller : typed rejection; no semantic object
  else complete valid scan
    Scan -> Construct : exact capacities and validated slices
    Construct -> Construct : decode keys and populate flat vectors
    alt key codec violation
      Construct --> Caller : typed rejection; no partial result
    else canonical values
      Construct -> Core : plan fields or checkpoint event kinds
      Core -> Core : construct and validate exact semantics
      alt foreign active plan or corrupt checkpoint
        Core --> Caller : typed rejection; no publication
      else exact semantic value
        Core -> Admission : complete unpublished value
        Admission -> Admission : final cancellation sample
        Admission --> Caller : publish exactly one complete value + metrics
      end
    end
  end
end

note over Admission,Scan #FEF3C7
No variable output allocation occurs before complete
header, item, work, cancellation, and scan admission.
end note

note over Construct,Core #DCFCE7
Digests aid integrity only. Exact structural equality
remains the checkpoint acceptance authority.
end note
@enduml
